.TH MYGREP 1 "September 2026" "OS Assignment" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search for a pattern in text
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mygrep
.RI pattern " file"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mygrep
program searches the specified file for lines containing the given pattern.
Each matching line is displayed as output.
The pattern is provided as the first argument and the file to search is provided as the second argument.
